WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.610
- All right, I always like to end things

00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:03.270
with a story to keep your spirits high.

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:04.525
So this is what I'm liking.

00:00:04.525 --> 00:00:08.070
(upbeat music)
(audience cheers)

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:10.710
It's awesome how kids can be so mesmerized

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:13.840
by what seems like relatively
simple things to us grownups.

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.290
Just check out this little girl walking

00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:17.989
by an impromptu photo shoot in New York.

00:00:17.989 --> 00:00:21.906
(extravagant orchestral music)

00:00:32.242 --> 00:00:35.330
(audience cheers)
- It's so adorable. (laughs)

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:36.163
I love it.

00:00:36.163 --> 00:00:39.057
She was like, "I love this.
I love what you're wearing."

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:44.910
That's already been viewed
over 68 million times.

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:46.280
It's incredible.
(audience cheers)

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:47.930
And we have the woman who is wearing

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:49.470
that white dress dialed in right now.

00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:51.240
Let's say hi to the very beautiful Monica,

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:53.495
who watches on NBC 4 Los Angeles.

00:00:53.495 --> 00:00:54.918
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:00:54.918 --> 00:00:56.410
Hi!

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:59.330
Well, first of all, you look
absolutely stunning then.

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:00.400
You look absolutely stunning now.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:04.053
But tell us about that very
sweet moment. That was adorable.

00:01:05.240 --> 00:01:06.930
- Yeah, I mean, it was so beautiful.

00:01:06.930 --> 00:01:09.840
So I was in New York for a gala

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:11.520
for the Fifteen Percent Pledge,

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:13.650
which is a nonprofit organization

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:15.930
that encourages retailers
to have at least 15%

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:18.929
of their shelf space dedicated
to Black-owned businesses.

00:01:18.929 --> 00:01:20.930
So I was excited to get dressed up.

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:23.100
We haven't been able
to do that in a while.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:26.160
And so my friend wanted to
take pictures of me downstairs.

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:28.080
And at first I was telling her no,

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:29.860
that I didn't want people staring at me,

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:31.100
but I'm glad we did

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:32.540
because, you know, we
got some great photos.

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:35.430
And while we were taking
photos outside the hotel,

00:01:35.430 --> 00:01:38.220
I noticed a dad and his
daughter were waiting

00:01:38.220 --> 00:01:39.650
for me to finish taking photos.

00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:42.210
And so I told him they can go
ahead and not to wait for me.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:45.410
And the dad said that his
little girl might take a while

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:47.920
because she had her stroller and her doll.

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:49.220
But I told them they can go ahead anyways.

00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:52.520
So, you know, she finishes her
walk and then the video kind

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:53.900
of picks up where she's finishing her walk

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:57.093
and she does a 180, which
I thought was so funny.

00:01:58.020 --> 00:02:00.660
And then she, you know, she's
mesmerized by the dress.

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:02.610
I didn't expect her to be
looking so closely at them,

00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:03.443
was the main thing.

00:02:03.443 --> 00:02:04.790
And I thought it was so cute

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:06.900
that she had the Black baby doll, as well.

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:10.020
So it was just a very sweet
moment and a surprise.

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:11.560
- It was. It was so great.

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:14.170
And yeah, she was looking at the dress,

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:17.400
but you look so breathtakingly
beautiful in the dress, too.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.500
And she was like, "What is this thing?

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:20.850
You are so beautiful."

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:21.683
I mean, she was just like,

00:02:21.683 --> 00:02:24.120
"I gotta touch on this beautiful."

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:25.530
It's gone super viral,

00:02:25.530 --> 00:02:28.900
so why do you think this has
resonated with so many people?

00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:31.340
- I mean, I think the
way that I've taken it as

00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:33.010
is I think a lot of people are put back

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:34.810
into that moment of when they're a child

00:02:34.810 --> 00:02:37.100
and they're seeing a lot of
things for the first time.

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:38.640
And so I think it kind of reminds a lot

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:40.440
of people to keep that
child-like curiosity

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:42.160
about the world and approach things

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:44.040
as if you're seeing it for the first time.

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:46.200
You know, it was just the dress, as well.

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:48.270
The designer, her name
was Vivian Valerius,

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:51.480
and that dress combined
with just the sweet moment,

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:54.710
I think, was just very
exciting for people to see.

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:56.140
- It's so artistic.

00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:58.520
Well, thank you so much, Monica,
for sharing that with us.

00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:00.444
I'm liking your post right now, right?

00:03:00.444 --> 00:03:01.430
(heart dings)

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:02.310
And that's not all.

00:03:02.310 --> 00:03:04.830
Our season-long partner,
Pilot, pen makers of G2,

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:06.760
the go-to pen of "The
Kelly Clarkson Show,"

00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:09.530
want to honor ultimate
overachievers just like you ma'am,

00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:10.530
so they're gonna be writing you a check

00:03:10.530 --> 00:03:11.380
for a thousand dollars.

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:12.267
How's that sound?

00:03:12.267 --> 00:03:13.387
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:03:13.387 --> 00:03:15.187
- That's amazing. Thank you so much.

